WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.600
Find an element, wait for a click, change the page

2
00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:08.276
JavaScript goes in a &lt;script&gt; block, after the HTML.

3
00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:12.902
Find the button whose I D is go, and wait for a click.

4
00:00:14.151 --> 00:00:17.126
...then find the message and change its words.

5
00:00:19.371 --> 00:00:20.896
Click Start.

6
00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:28.281
The page changed. A later course explains every part of this recipe.
